{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17737","headline":"和人与人分惠赐冰 · 杨巨源","name":"和人与人分惠赐冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天水藏来玉堕空，先颁密署几人同。\n映盘皎洁非资月，披扇清凉不在风。\n莹质方从纶阁内，凝辉更向画堂中。\n丽词珍贶难双有，迢遰金舆殿角东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17737.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17737","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}